u:m011-0539","start":539,"end":541,"surface":"將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0545","start":545,"end":547,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0557","start":557,"end":559,"surface":"桓楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000652","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0562","start":562,"end":564,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0565","start":565,"end":567,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0569","start":569,"end":571,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0573","start":573,"end":575,"surface":"將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0576","start":576,"end":579,"surface":"當陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000680","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0580","start":580,"end":583,"surface":"蒲將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000657","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0585","start":585,"end":587,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p012","text":"項羽已殺卿子冠軍，威震楚國，名聞諸侯。乃遣當陽君、蒲將軍將卒二萬渡河，救鉅鹿。戰少利，陳餘復請兵。項羽乃悉引兵渡河，皆沈船，破釜甑，燒廬舍，持三日糧，以示士卒必死，無一還心。於是至則圍王離，與秦軍遇，九戰，絕其甬道，大破之，殺蘇角，虜王離。涉閒不降楚，自燒殺。當是時，楚兵冠諸侯。諸侯軍救鉅鹿下者十餘壁，莫敢縱兵。及楚擊秦，諸將皆從壁上觀。楚戰士無不一以當十，楚兵呼聲動天，諸侯軍無不人人惴恐。於是已破秦軍，項羽召見諸侯將，入轅門，無不膝行而前，莫敢仰視。項羽由是始為諸侯上將軍，諸侯皆屬焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"卿子冠軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"當陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000680","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"蒲將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000657","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000675","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"蘇角","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000681","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"涉閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000677","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0208","start":208,"end":211,"surface":"諸侯將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0228","start":228,"end":230,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p013","text":"章邯軍棘原，項羽軍漳南，相持未戰。秦軍數卻，二世使人讓章邯。章邯恐，使長史欣請事。至咸陽，留司馬門三日，趙高不見，有不信之心。長史欣恐，還走其軍，不敢出故道，趙高果使人追之，不及。欣至軍，報曰：「趙高用事於中，下無可為者。今戰能勝，高必疾妒吾功；戰不能勝，不免於死。願將軍孰計之。」陳餘亦遺章邯書曰：「白起為秦將，南征鄢郢，北阬馬服，攻城略地，不可勝計，而竟賜死。蒙恬為秦將，北逐戎人，開榆中地數千里，竟斬陽周。何者？功多，秦不能盡封，因以法誅之。今將軍為秦將三歲矣，所亡失以十萬數，而諸侯并起滋益多。彼趙高素諛日久，今事急，亦恐二世誅之，故欲以法誅將軍以塞責，使人更代將軍以脫其禍。夫將軍居外久，多內卻，有功亦誅，無功亦誅。且天之亡秦，無愚智皆知之。今將軍內不能直諫，外為亡國將，孤特獨立而欲常存，豈不哀哉！將軍何不還兵與諸侯為從，約共攻秦，分王其地，南面稱孤；此孰與身伏鈇質，妻子為僇乎？」章邯狐疑，陰使候始成使項羽，欲約。約未成，項羽使蒲將軍日夜引兵度三戶，軍漳南，與秦戰，再破之。項羽悉引兵擊秦軍汙水上，大破之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"長史欣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000606","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000535","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m013-0063","start":63,"end":