：「章將軍等詐吾屬降諸侯，今能入關破秦，大善；即不能，諸侯虜吾屬而東，秦必盡誅吾父母妻子。」諸侯微聞其計，以告項羽。項羽乃召黥布、蒲將軍計曰：「秦吏卒尚眾，其心不服，至關中不聽，事必危，不如擊殺之，而獨與章邯、長史欣、都尉翳入秦。」於是楚軍夜擊阬秦卒二十餘萬人新安城南。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"諸侯吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0019","start":19,"end":23,"surface":"秦中吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0036","start":36,"end":40,"surface":"諸侯吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"秦吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"秦吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"章將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0102","start":102,"end":106,"surface":"父母妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0127","start":127,"end":130,"surface":"蒲將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000657","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0134","start":134,"end":137,"surface":"秦吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0167","start":167,"end":170,"surface":"長史欣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000606","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m015-0171","start":171,"end":174,"surface":"都尉翳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000607","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p002","text":"陳勝之起也，布乃見番君，與其眾叛秦，聚兵數千人。番君以其女妻之。章邯之滅陳勝，破呂臣軍，布乃引兵北擊秦左右校，破之清波，引兵而東。聞項梁定江東會稽，涉江而西。陳嬰以項氏世為楚將，乃以兵屬項梁，渡淮南，英布、蒲將軍亦以兵屬項梁。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"陳勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005065","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"番君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005063","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"番君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005063","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"其女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005064","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005066","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"陳勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005065","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"呂臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"陳嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005069","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"項氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、族稱或群體不補姓名成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"英布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"蒲將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005061","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m002-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu","book_id":"b-shiji-091","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-091-qingbu"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p003","text":"項梁涉淮而西，擊景駒、秦嘉等，布常冠軍。項梁至薛，聞陳王定死，迺立楚懷王。項梁號為武信君，英布為當陽君。項梁敗死定陶，懷王徙都彭城，諸將英布亦皆保聚彭城。當是時，秦急圍趙，趙數使人請救。懷王使宋義為上將，范曾為末將，項籍為次將，英布、蒲將軍皆為將軍，悉屬宋義，北救趙。及項籍殺宋義於河上，懷王因立籍為上將軍，諸將皆屬項籍。項籍使布先渡河擊秦，布數有利，籍迺悉引兵涉河從之，遂破秦軍，降章邯等。楚兵常勝，功冠諸侯。諸侯兵皆以服屬楚者，以布數以少敗眾也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"景駒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005070","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"秦嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005071","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005065","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"英布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"英布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m003-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005072","status":"contextua